+--!strict
+-- The Cinderveil dress (zone armour, Aor'lan Mountain): a basalt-black gown
+-- with ash-grey accents, as a mountain devotee would wear it. The pale stole,
+-- stomacher and belt keep light on the figure; the bodice and the skirt panel
+-- are near-black. A thick magma crack glows down the stomacher, and the skirt
+-- falls in one tall panel per leg that angles out from the hip instead of
+-- stepping in tiers.
+local ArmourLookTypes = require("../../ArmourLookTypes")
+local Kit = require("./Kit")
+
+local c = {
+	basalt = { 34, 32, 34 },
+	basaltEdge = { 62, 58, 60 },
+	ash = { 154, 150, 142 },
+	ashPale = { 188, 184, 174 },
